(a) the first information, if any; : (b) the Magistrate's charge; () statement under Section 164,if any;
(d) examination under Section 342 and 364, if any;
(e) the commitment order;
(f) post mortem report, Chemical Examiner's Reports, Inquest Report (if any), map (if any);
